WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.500
WiFi settings on an Android tablet. Tap on Wipkingen Airport Free.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.500
A certificate warning appears only because of our lab's test certificate. A real attacker with a valid certificate for its own lookalike domain gets none. Continue anyway via browser.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.000
The attacker's sign-in page opens and asks for card details, "to verify your identity".

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Name, card number, expiry and CVC are typed in.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.400
One tap on Connect now, and the card details go to the attacker.
